         "settings": {
          "tabs": [
           {
            "_id": "5b0300e",
            "tab_title": "How long does a typical project take?",
            "tab_content": "<p>Most projects take four to eight weeks from the first call to launch. We agree on a schedule with clear milestones before any work starts, so you always know what happens next.</p>"
           },
           {
            "_id": "5b0300f",
            "tab_title": "What does it cost?",
            "tab_content": "<p>Every quote is fixed and itemised. After a short discovery call we send a proposal with the scope, the timeline and the price, with no hidden extras later on.</p>"
           },
           {
            "_id": "5b03010",
            "tab_title": "Can I make changes after launch?",
            "tab_content": "<p>Yes. You get a simple editor and a walkthrough, so updating text, photos and pages is something you can do yourself in minutes.</p>"
           },
           {
            "_id": "5b03011",
            "tab_title": "Do you offer ongoing support?",
            "tab_content": "<p>We offer monthly care plans that cover updates, backups, small changes and a direct line to the people who built your site.</p>"
           },
           {
            "_id": "5b03012",
            "tab_title": "Which payment methods do you accept?",
            "tab_content": "<p>Bank transfer and all major cards. Larger projects are split into three payments tied to milestones.</p>"
           }
